<title>INDIA: India Reliance shareholder meet in June.</title>
<headline>India Reliance shareholder meet in June.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private firm Reliance Industries will hold its annual shareholders meeting on June 26, a company spokesman told Reuters on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
